## NOSS Structure per CoCu

Each CoCu .md file in `content/` follows this structure:
1. NOSS header table (Program Code, Level, Unit Title, Work Activities, Code, Page)
2. Set-up context table (2 scenarios)
3. Key terms / tools table (Type + Description)
4. Contact hour distribution (% / Hrs / Activity / Knowledge 30% / Performance 70%)
5. Hardware/Software component descriptions
6. Common faults table (Fault / Cause / Action)

Gold standard: `content/IT-020-3/01_cocu-1-computer-system-set-up.md`

## Build Commands

```bash
# Generate .docx from .md content
uv run --with python-docx --with markdown scripts/generate_docx.py

# Upload to Google Drive
uv run scripts/sync_to_gdrive.py

# Run full cron cycle (AI refine + rebuild + upload)
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/cron_refine.ps1
```

