## Rules

- Content .md files are the single source of truth — never edit .docx directly
- NOSS allocation: 30% Knowledge / 70% Performance per competency unit
- All CoCu enrichment must match the L3 CoCu 1 gold standard pattern
- Use `uv` for all Python operations

